OL,3,GNEWSAPotentially paralysed tourist
OL,4,Astranded in Greece after balcony fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish tourist who fell from a
OL,7,Fbalcony in Greece is unable to travel
OL,8,Fhome due to the cost of a specialist
OL,9,Fflight.
OL,11,FDenby McLaren from Larkhall cannot
OL,12,Fcurrently use her legs after the
OL,13,Fthree-storey fall, which happened while
OL,14,Fshe was visiting Rhodes to celebrate
OL,15,Fher 30th birthday.
OL,17,FShe has a broken vertebra and multiple
OL,18,Ffractures to her foot, with her family
OL,19,Fnow waiting to learn if she has
OL,20,Fsuffered permanent injuries.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
