OL,3,GNEWSAPotentially paralysed tourist
OL,4,Astranded in Greece after balcony fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air ambulance offering stretcher and
OL,7,Fmedical assistance is needed to get
OL,8,Fback to Scotland, but these are not
OL,9,Fcovered by her travel insurance. A
OL,10,Ffundraiser has now been set up to help.
